{"kind":"html","caption":"用三个引用完成原地反转：prev 指向已反转部分，curr 指向当前节点，next 临时保存尚未处理的后继。每轮先保存 next，再把 curr.next 改指 prev，随后两个引用向右推进；当 curr 为空时，prev 就是新头节点。递归写法本质相同，只是先反转后半段，再让后继节点指回当前节点。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>反转链表可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.status{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.45}\n.mono,.value,.step-num{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.chain{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:4px;min-height:56px}\n.node-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}\n.node{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;transition:background .3s,border-color .3s}\n.node.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.node.done{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;opacity:.75}\n.value{font-size:14px;text-align:center;padding-top:2px}\n.labels{font-size:10px;text-align:center;color:#8d8d8d;line-height:1.2;padding-bottom:2px}\n.node.active .labels,.node.active .value{color:#fff}\n.arrow{color:#8d8d8d;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px}\n.nil{padding:2px 6px;border:1px dashed #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 8px;margin-top:6px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.key{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;margin-right:4px;border:1px solid #3794ff;background:#0e639c;vertical-align:-1px}\n.operations{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}\n.op{flex:1 1 120px;padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;font-size:10px;line-height:1.4}\n.op.on{border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c;color:#fff}\n.op strong{display:block;color:#3794ff;margin-bottom:2px;font-size:10px}\n.op.on strong{color:#fff}\n.progress{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot{padding:2px 6px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;color:#8d8d8d;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:10px}\n.dot.current{color:#fff;border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c}\n.note{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;color:#8d8d8d}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>反转链表：迭代</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">示例 <span class=\"mono\">[1,2,3,4,5]</span>，展示指针与箭头方向。</p>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">当前状态</div>\n<div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div>\n<div id=\"chain\" class=\"chain\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"key\"></i>修改中</span><span class=\"mono\">prev / curr / next</span></div>\n<div id=\"progress\" class=\"progress\"></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"operations\">\n<div id=\"op0\" class=\"op\"><strong>① 保存后继</strong><span class=\"mono\">next=curr.next</span></div>\n<div id=\"op1\" class=\"op\"><strong>② 改方向</strong><span class=\"mono\">curr.next=prev</span></div>\n<div id=\"op2\" class=\"op\"><strong>③ 推进</strong><span class=\"mono\">prev=curr; curr=next</span></div>\n</section>\n<p class=\"note\"><strong style=\"color:#3794ff\">结束：</strong><span class=\"mono\">curr=null</span> 时 <span class=\"mono\">prev</span> 为新头；时间 <span class=\"mono\">O(n)</span>，额外 <span class=\"mono\">O(1)</span>。</p>\n</main>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  const values = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5];\n  const frames = [];\n  frames.push({ phase: -1, processed: 0, curr: 0, next: null, text: '初始化：prev = null，curr 指向头节点 1。' });\n  for (let i = 0; i < values.length; i++) {\n    frames.push({ phase: 0, processed: i, curr: i, next: i + 1, text: '保存节点 ' + values[i] + ' 的后继：next 指向 ' + (values[i + 1] === undefined ? 'null' : values[i + 1]) + '。' });\n    frames.push({ phase: 1, processed: i + 1, curr: i, next: i + 1, text: '反转箭头：让节点 ' + values[i] + ' 指向 ' + (i === 0 ? 'null' : values[i - 1]) + '。' });\n    frames.push({ phase: 2, processed: i + 1, curr: i + 1, next: null, text: '推进指针：prev 移到 ' + values[i] + '，curr 移到 ' + (values[i + 1] === undefined ? 'null' : values[i + 1]) + '。' });\n  }\n  frames.push({ phase: 3, processed: values.length, curr: values.length, next: null, text: '完成：curr = null，新链表为 5 → 4 → 3 → 2 → 1 → null。' });\n\n  const chain = document.getElementById('chain');\n  const status = document.getElementById('status');\n  const progress = document.getElementById('progress');\n  let frameIndex = 0;\n\n  frames.forEach(function (_, i) {\n    const dot = document.createElement('span');\n    dot.className = 'dot';\n    dot.textContent = i + 1;\n    progress.appendChild(dot);\n  });\n\n  function labelsFor(index, f) {\n    const labels = [];\n    if (f.processed > 0 && index === f.processed - 1) labels.push('prev');\n    if (index === f.curr && f.curr < values.length) labels.push('curr');\n    if (f.phase === 0 && index === f.next && f.next < values.length) labels.push('next');\n    if (index === 0 && frameIndex === 0) labels.push('head');\n    return labels.length ? labels : ['·'];\n  }\n\n  function addNode(value, index, f, mode) {\n    const wrap = document.createElement('div');\n    wrap.className = 'node-wrap';\n    const node = document.createElement('div');\n    node.className = 'node';\n    if (mode === 'active') node.classList.add('active');\n    if (mode === 'done') node.classList.add('done');\n    const valueBox = document.createElement('div');\n    valueBox.className = 'value';\n    valueBox.textContent = value;\n    const labels = document.createElement('div');\n    labels.className = 'labels';\n    labelsFor(index, f).forEach(function (label) {\n      const line = document.createElement('span');\n      line.textContent = label;\n      labels.appendChild(line);\n    });\n    node.appendChild(valueBox);\n    node.appendChild(labels);\n    wrap.appendChild(node);\n    return wrap;\n  }\n\n  function addArrow(wrap, isLast) {\n    const arrow = document.createElement('span');\n    arrow.className = isLast ? 'nil' : 'arrow';\n    arrow.textContent = isLast ? 'null' : '→';\n    wrap.appendChild(arrow);\n  }\n\n  function render() {\n    const f = frames[frameIndex];\n    status.innerHTML = '<span class=\"step-num\">步骤 ' + (frameIndex + 1) + ' / ' + frames.length + '</span><br>' + f.text;\n    chain.innerHTML = '';\n\n    const order = [];\n    for (let i = f.processed - 1; i >= 0; i--) order.push(i);\n    for (let i = f.processed; i < values.length; i++) order.push(i);\n\n    order.forEach(function (index, position) {\n      let mode = index < f.processed ? 'done' : '';\n      if (index === f.curr && f.curr < values.length) mode = 'active';\n      const wrap = addNode(values[index], index, f, mode);\n      const boundary = f.processed > 0 && position === f.processed - 1;\n      const finalNode = position === order.length - 1;\n      if (!finalNode) {\n        const arrow = document.createElement('span');\n        arrow.className = 'arrow';\n        arrow.textContent = boundary ? '|' : '→';\n        wrap.appendChild(arrow);\n      } else {\n        addArrow(wrap, true);\n      }\n      chain.appendChild(wrap);\n    });\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.op').forEach(function (op) { op.classList.remove('on'); });\n    if (f.phase >= 0 && f.phase <= 2) document.getElementById('op' + f.phase).classList.add('on');\n    document.querySelectorAll('.dot').forEach(function (dot, i) { dot.classList.toggle('current', i === frameIndex); });\n  }\n\n  render();\n  setInterval(function () {\n    frameIndex = (frameIndex + 1) % frames.length;\n    render();\n  }, 1800);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
